WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.810
A screenshot rarely explains itself.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.060
Meet Snapper. Capture, annotate and share from your menu bar.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.040
Press a shortcut and grab any part of your screen.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.750
Then mark it up. Boxes, arrows, numbered steps, a magnifier, and blur.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.950
Give it a background.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.960
Then copy it, or share a link.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.190
Paste it anywhere, and everyone gets the point.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.800
Need motion? Record, trim, and send.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.790
Snapper. Invite only.
